  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study visit introduction seed chain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to support the seed sector in Jordan by inviting the Seed Technology Lab at the National Center for Agricultural Research and Extension, the Plant Protection Directorate, and the New Plant Variety Protection Office for an introduction to how they organize the seed chain. The main purpose of this meeting is to facilitate interaction between these organizations and pave the way for future support by Dutch experts.</narrative>
  </description>
